    "In its uppermost reach through Rajasthan the Sabarmati is locally called the Wakal before taking its better-known name.",
    "The river bisects Ahmedabad, founded on its banks in 1411, and today its urban stretch is regulated by the Sabarmati Riverfront Development project.",
